DCP I10 managed-source laboratory integration

This repository records the architecture/integration contract and pins the
private managed DCP Orchestrator source. DCP Orchestrator includes software
from Agent Orchestrator, Copyright 2026 Untrivial, licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. Exact LICENSE, NOTICE, provenance and modified application source
live in https://github.com/orenvlad-ai/dcp-orchestrator at the commit pinned in
upstream/dcp-orchestrator.lock.

The managed fork is fetched outside Git at one immutable commit. Official
upstream remains a read-only provenance reference inside its preserved Git
history. DCP product identity, namespace, lifecycle, worker isolation and
release gates are reviewable fork commits. The retired repository patch queue
remains historical Git evidence and is no longer an active source path.

No application source or binary is committed or distributed by this
repository. The local user-owned artifact is named DCP Orchestrator and
identifies the pinned Agent Orchestrator foundation in its bundle metadata.
